"Biscuit downloads official Electron 41.10.7 (113 MiB on Apple silicon or 119 MiB on Intel; extracted payload about 275 MiB and 303 MiB respectively). The ZIP and Electron executable are SHA-256 verified before use. Biscuit retains the complete official runtime payload and its LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html notices in a private folder. Nothing is installed globally; personal browser profiles, Codex, and shared runtimes are untouched. Electron's sandbox and OS protections remain enabled." = "Biscuit 会下载官方 Electron 41.10.7（Apple silicon 版本为 113 MiB，Intel 版本为 119 MiB；解压后嘅内容分别约为 275 MiB 和 303 MiB）。ZIP 档案和 Electron 可执行档会喺使用前经过 SHA-256 验证。Biscuit 会喺私有资料夹保留完整嘅官方运行环境内容，以及 LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html 声明。唔会进行全域安装；个人浏览器资料、Codex 同共用运行环境都唔会受影响。Electron 沙盒同作业系统保护功能会继续启用。";
