"Uses a Biscuit-owned Claude OAuth session through the official Messages streaming endpoint. Sign in from Account Settings; tokens are stored in a separate Biscuit Keychain service. Biscuit never reads Claude Code credentials; native Claude remaining usage is queried only when you explicitly select Refresh in Provider Settings." = "使用 Biscuit 管理嘅 Claude OAuth 会话，通过官方 Messages 串流端点连线。喺帐户设定登入；权杖只会储存喺独立嘅 Biscuit Keychain 服务入面。Biscuit 绝不会读取 Claude Code 凭证；只有喺你明确喺「服务提供方设定」拣选「重新整理」时，先会查询原生 Claude 嘅剩余用量。";
"Uses biscuit's own ChatGPT subscription session with the ChatGPT Codex Responses streaming endpoint. No CLI or API key is used; provider-side compatibility and account access may change." = "使用 biscuit 自有嘅 ChatGPT 订阅会话，并透过 ChatGPT Codex Responses 串流端点连线；唔会使用 CLI 或 API 金钥。服务提供方一侧嘅兼容性同帐户存取权限可能会有变。";
"Uses the language macOS currently prefers for text recognition." = "使用 macOS 目前偏好用嚟识别文字嘅语言。";
"Verifying the ChatGPT session from its visible composer. The saved profile is preserved if verification fails." = "正喺根据 ChatGPT 可见嘅撰写框验证会话。如果验证失败，会保留已储存嘅个人档案。";
